   "en": "Exemption and opt-in requests are made in your U-Pass portal, starting August 15 for fall, December 15 for winter and April 15 for spring-summer. For a full refund for Winter 2027, the deadline is January 29, 2027; after that, the refund is prorated. No exemptions can be submitted after the last day to withdraw from a course, and refunds are credited to your student account."
