   "en": "Anyone working in a lab, whether paid or as part of a course, must complete their training within the first month: WHMIS for lab workers (valid 5 years), plus Laboratory Safety and Autoclave Safety (valid 4 years), and sometimes biosafety, laser or radiation safety. You also need to complete the Orientation Form and Access Form, signed by your supervisor and sent to your departmental office; allow 48 hours for the access card."
