   "en": "INSPIRE is a shared research facility for studying human behaviour. It offers standard four-station suites, a single suite, an eye-tracking suite, a focus group room and a control room, with physiological measures such as ECG, electrodermal activity and respiration. Researchers book rooms in Infinity once their account is created; only principal investigators pay the membership fee."
