   "en": "If you've completed or are completing an undergraduate degree at the University of Ottawa or another Canadian university with at least 80% (A-) in your last 60 units, you don't need GMAT or GRE scores; otherwise, one of them is required. If English isn't your first language, you need proof such as a TOEFL score of at least 100, IELTS of at least 7 in three of the four tests and 6 in the fourth, or a PTE Academic score of at least 68."
